        "cash_earned": 0,
        "created_at": "2025-07-21T12:02:51.19164+00:00",
        "notes": "First off, let me justify going for double boop before [Fast Forward](item_b5076f54-8bac-4202-9a7f-75b8c3d91633). The first reason is that double boop, especially combined with [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8), is just that good. When you're in a duel, you can juggle your opponent for long enough to kill them without them ever being able to fight back, and that's more valuable than +30% damage in my opinion. The second reason, is that at this point in the build, you don't have enough damage to really justify going full DPS. A lot of the time, you're going to be on healing mode, even while dealing damage, and so Fast Forward is a bit wasted there. \n\nYou're free to try out a different order if you want, I expect you'll end up agreeing with me anyway.\n\n[Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) is the best item in the game, and you won't change my mind. Not only does it give you great stats for its cost and regen, but since it gradually gives you armor, as long as it is active, it's kind of like your whole health bar is armor. The reason for that is, if a shot goes through even 1 armor point, it gets its damage reduced (by 7). So since you're continually regenerating armor, you'll always have a point of armor (of course it's different with shotguns since every pellet hits you at the same time). \n\nI used to use  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) all the time with it, but I find that there isn't much of a point unless facing against shotguns for the reason outlined above. On top of that, as long as you have 100 total armor/shield, it's very unlikely for the regen effect to go to waste (unless you're full health). It would require you to use 3 abilities spaced 2 seconds apart each while not taking any damage.\n\nSo if you want to replace speed skates with something, or you have the space for another blue, my recommendation is [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0), unless you're fighting against weapon power Dva or reaper, in which case  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) is better.",
