        "notes": "This is where the build becomes OP. The really nasty part about [Fast Forward](item_b5076f54-8bac-4202-9a7f-75b8c3d91633) is that it also boosts the damage you deal with  [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) (and possibly  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429), I've never tested it). So now you have a lot of damage and kill power, on top of being extremely tanky and mobile. It's time to go full DPS (well, save that you should still amp up healing on your team when you can, especially your other support). \n\nOnce you make it here, you know that you're likely going to win, even if you're losing 1-3.",
